  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, a demon hunter can recognize the handiwork of any creation of infernals, learning if an item was crafted by one or if it is a magical effect. The demon hunter must make a successful DC 25 Knowledge (planes) check (for the works and constructs of outsiders), Knowledge (religion) check (for the works and constructs of undead), or Knowledge (nature) check (for the works and constructs of fey). The demon hunter receives a bonus to this check equal to her class level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/demon-hunter#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
